        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-02T21:17:26+09:30" end-time-local="2026-10-02T21:17:26+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-02T11:47:26Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-02T11:47:26Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough in the southeast with a low pressure system developing near the Victorian border will also move further east. In the west, a high pressure system will move into the Bight and slowly move east to be centred over Victoria on Monday, while extending a ridge into parts of the state. Another trough near the WA border is expected to develop from Saturday and extend into the state before weakening by Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
