                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the west in the afternoon and evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h becoming light in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching around 17.</text>
